em><item><title><![CDATA[Engineers used 500,000 cubic yards of Mississippi River sand to build 7 islands and restore 270 acres]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134451953.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Engineers have successfully finalized a habitat restoration initiative at McGregor Lake, utilizing sand from the Mississippi River. This ambitious project involved the construction of seven islands, the enhancement of floodplain forests, and the protection of vital wetlands. The undertaking, spanning six years, has revitalized over 270 acres of aquatic habitats, significantly benefiting local wildlife and fostering greater biodiversity, all while striving to harmonize navigation and ecological preservation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/engineers-dredged-500000-cubic-yards-of-sand-from-the-mississippi-river-and-used-it-to-build-seven-islands-six-years-later-the-25-million-mcgregor-lake-project-has-restored-270-acres-of-aquatic-habitat-and-protected-22-acres-of-wetlands/articleshow/134451953.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/engineers-dredged-500000-cubic-yards-of-sand-from-the-mississippi-river-and-used-it-to-build-seven-islands-six-years-later-the-25-million-mcgregor-lake-project-has-restored-270-acres-of-aquatic-habitat-and-protected-22-acres-of-wetlands/articleshow/134451953.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-24T13:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134452021,imgsize-1020082.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Simone Biles lists Texas home for $1.2M after moving into her dream mansion]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134450702.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/while-simone-biles-and-jonathan-owens-built-their-texas-dream-mansion-biles-used-a-3998-sq-ft-home-as-a-temporary-base-with-the-custom-build-finished-the-1-acre-property-is-now-listed-for-1-2-million/articleshow/134450702.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/while-simone-biles-and-jonathan-owens-built-their-texas-dream-mansion-biles-used-a-3998-sq-ft-home-as-a-temporary-base-with-the-custom-build-finished-the-1-acre-property-is-now-listed-for-1-2-million/articleshow/134450702.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-24T09:16:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134450722,imgsize-115524.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Australian homeowner blames six trees for damage to her 130-year-old home; court finds no link]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134453013.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A homeowner in Australia blamed six neighbouring trees for damage to her 130-year-old heritage home and sought $23,650.86 for repairs and tree removal. The NSW Land and Environment Court rejected her claim, finding that evidence did not establish a causal link between the trees and the damage, with moisture conditions and other factors identified as possible causes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australian-homeowner-blamed-six-neighbouring-trees-for-damage-to-her-130-year-old-heritage-home-and-sought-23650-86-for-repairs-nsw-court-rejected-the-claim-after-finding-no-proven-link-to-the-trees/articleshow/134453013.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australian-homeowner-blamed-six-neighbouring-trees-for-damage-to-her-130-year-old-heritage-home-and-sought-23650-86-for-repairs-nsw-court-rejected-the-claim-after-finding-no-proven-link-to-the-trees/articleshow/134453013.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-24T12:07:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134453616,imgsize-233826.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New Jersey AI data center hit with record $1.07M penalty over 62 gas generators]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134451711.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-jersey-inspectors-found-62-large-natural-gas-generators-running-without-required-permits-at-a-massive-ai-data-center-the-state-has-now-imposed-a-record-1-07-million-penalty/articleshow/134451711.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-jersey-inspectors-found-62-large-natural-gas-generators-running-without-required-permits-at-a-massive-ai-data-center-the-state-has-now-imposed-a-record-1-07-million-penalty/articleshow/134451711.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-24T12:01:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134451766,imgsize-124950.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California households get summer electricity credits as state returns $886 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134451670.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[This summer, California is stepping up to support households with automatic electricity bill credits for August and September. A total of $886 million will be distributed among utility customers, granting an average of $75 off their bills without any application process. Funded through the Cap-and-Invest initiative, these credits aim to alleviate financial stress during peak energy usage, ensuring relief during the hottest months of the year.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/millions-of-california-households-are-getting-electricity-bill-credits-automatically-during-the-expensive-summer-months-the-state-says-886-million-is-being-returned-averaging-about-75-per-household/articleshow/134451670.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/millions-of-california-households-are-getting-electricity-bill-credits-automatically-during-the-expensive-summer-months-the-state-says-886-million-is-being-returned-averaging-about-75-per-household/articleshow/134451670.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-24T11:08:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134451730,imgsize-944547.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[At 90, former paratrooper sets world-best 10K time for his age]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134441185.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ninety-year-old Ian Winship from North Lanarkshire has made headlines by completing a 10-kilometre race, achieving a remarkable time that sets a world-best record in the M90 category as per Scottish Athletics. His daily fitness routine, involving extensive walking, keeps him energized and motivated. Joined by his daughter and grandson during the race, Winship's determination has received praise from local authorities, serving as an inspiration to many within the community.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/at-90-former-paratrooper-ian-winship-runs-10k-in-about-an-hour-with-daughter-and-grand